      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would be incredibly useful to me as a streamer. I'd be able to make my mods a remote to operate the camera, so they can fiddle with it while I'm in VR. Also be able to switch between pinned cameras.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
