      "value": "God with a lot of modern cameras they have wifi based interfaces to sync up to a computer, you could even have an app that links an actual physical camera to the vrchat camera and stick a tracker on it and use it as a physical controller!\n\nOr make camera controllers with arduino stuff. Even networking it to have a focus puller working with a camera op. The possibilities here are really wonderful!\n\nThis is such a cool suggestion",
